# Robust setup for projects

This set of rules are designed for cross-machine and different projects development. trat it as a series of checklist items that help keep a consistant developer experience.

## 1 — Pin Node.js with .nvmrc

Add a .nvmrc to each project:
Suggests to run `nvm use` on entry new projects/machines.

Default .nvmrc:

```
22.14.0
```

## 2 - Prefer pinned dev dependecies

With a pinned version + committed lockfile, every machine gets the identical binary path.

## 3 - Suggest a dockerfile for projects with Playwrite

to make more efficient use of the browser binaries
